  <div class="container">
    <ul>
<li class="ch">一个生机勃勃的卡通动漫动物世界大聚会，色彩鲜艳且充满活力。森林的中心地带装饰着五彩斑斓的气球和彩带，各种可爱的拟人化小动物，如戴着派对帽的长颈鹿、跳舞的兔子和正在演奏乐器的小熊，正快乐地欢聚在一起。背景是梦幻的树屋和闪烁的萤火虫，采用吉卜力风格的柔和光影，充满童趣与温馨的氛围，高分辨率，细腻的笔触，细节丰富，极其生动。</li>
<li class="en">A vibrant cartoon anime animal world party, full of bright colors and energy. The heart of the forest is decorated with colorful balloons and streamers, with various cute anthropomorphic animals, such as giraffes wearing party hats, dancing rabbits, and bears playing instruments, gathering together happily. The background features dreamlike treehouses and sparkling fireflies, rendered in a Ghibli-style with soft lighting, evoking a sense of childlike wonder and warmth, high resolution, fine brushstrokes, rich in detail, extremely vivid.</li>
</ul>
<hr/><ul>
<li class="ch">超高清晰度的动漫风格插画，展现了一场热闹的动物大联欢。在一片郁郁葱葱的草地上，一只穿着西装的狐狸正在分发礼物，旁边是一群正在野餐的小猪和松鼠。画风采用精致的赛璐珞质感，明亮的阳光洒在草地上，色彩饱和度高，充满欢乐的叙事感。细节包括每只动物独特的表情和精致的配饰，画面构图广阔且充满细节，给人一种电影级别的视觉享受，充满趣味与和谐感。</li>
<li class="en">Ultra-high definition anime-style illustration depicting a lively animal jamboree. On a lush green meadow, a fox in a suit is handing out gifts, surrounded by a group of pigs and squirrels having a picnic. The art style uses a refined cel-shading texture, with bright sunlight shining on the grass, high color saturation, and a joyful narrative sense. Details include the unique expressions and delicate accessories of each animal, wide composition filled with intricate details, providing a cinematic visual experience, full of fun and harmony.</li>
</ul>
<hr/><ul>
<li class="ch">可爱风动漫艺术，描绘了一个充满魔法色彩的动物聚会场景。画面中心是一张巨大的长桌，上面摆满了甜点和水果，狮子、猫咪、小鸟和考拉围坐在一起，神态各异，欢声笑语。背景是充满奇幻色彩的森林，有着巨大的蘑菇和闪烁的星空。画面风格偏向清新疗愈，使用温暖的色调和柔和的勾线，营造出一种乌托邦式的聚会氛围，构图精致，极具商业插画的高级感。</li>
<li class="en">Cute anime art, depicting a magical animal party scene. At the center of the frame is a huge long table filled with desserts and fruits, where lions, cats, birds, and koalas are sitting together, with different expressions, laughing and talking. The background is a fantasy forest with giant mushrooms and a sparkling starry sky. The style leans towards fresh and healing, using warm tones and soft outlines to create a utopian party atmosphere, exquisite composition, highly professional commercial illustration feel.</li>
</ul>
